<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ru">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <title>Payme — скоро</title>
    <script>
      (function () {
        var stored = localStorage.getItem("tutorbook-theme");
        var dark =
          stored === "dark" ||
          (!stored && window.matchMedia("(prefers-color-scheme: dark)").matches);
        if (dark) document.documentElement.classList.add("dark");
      })();
    </script>
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    <script>
      tailwind.config = {
        darkMode: "class",
        theme: {
          extend: {
            colors: {
              alabaster: "#FAF7F9",
              ivory: "#FFFFFF",
              emeraldink: "#1F1624",
              moss: "#6B21A8",
              line: "#EAE2E8",
              night: "#110C15",
              dusk: "#1B1422",
              linight: "#2E2238",
              mist: "#F5F0F7",
              amethyst: "#A855F7",
            },
            fontFamily: {
              display: ['"Cormorant Garamond"', "Georgia", "serif"],
              sans: ['"Sora"', "system-ui", "sans-serif"],
            },
          },
        },
      };
    </script>
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
    <link
      href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cormorant+Garamond:ital,wght@0,600;0,700&family=Sora:wght@400;500;600&display=swap"
      rel="stylesheet"
    />
  </head>
  <body class="min-h-screen bg-alabaster text-emeraldink font-sans dark:bg-night dark:text-mist">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-md px-4 py-16">
      <p class="text-sm text-moss dark:text-amethyst">Заглушка</p>
      <h1 class="mt-2 font-display text-4xl">Payme Checkout</h1>
      <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-emeraldink/70 dark:text-mist/70">
        Касса Payme ещё не подключена. Запись №<%= booking.id %> сохранена со статусом «Ожидает оплаты».
      </p>
      <p class="mt-4 rounded-3xl border border-line bg-ivory p-5 text-sm dark:border-linight dark:bg-dusk">
        <%= booking.student_name %> · <%= booking.service %><br />
        <%= booking.date %> в <%= booking.time_slot %> · <%= amountLabel %>
      </p>
      <form action="/payment/payme/stub" method="POST" class="mt-6 space-y-3">
        <input type="hidden" name="booking_id" value="<%= booking.id %>" />
        <button type="submit" class="w-full rounded-full bg-moss py-3 text-ivory dark:bg-amethyst dark:text-night">
          Отметить оплату (тест)
        </button>
      </form>
      <a href="/" class="mt-6 inline-block text-sm underline">Вернуться на сайт</a>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
